<title>USA: TABLE - Global Industries Ltd Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Global Industries Ltd Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LAFAYETTE, La. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>STATISTICS - Global Industries, Ltd. 1997	 1996</p>
<p>(In thousands, except per share and operating data)</p>
<p>Quarter ended June 30,</p>
<p> Revenues				     $63,176	   $50,332</p>
<p> Operating income			    14,936	     9,383</p>
<p> Net income				    10,119	     6,643</p>
<p> Average shares				46,567	39,436 (a)</p>
<p> Net income per share			  0.22	 0. 17 (a)</p>
<p> Barge days					 444		 332</p>
<p> Liftboat and DSV days			1,563	     1,320</p>
<p> Diver days				     8,781	     3,545</p>
<p>(a) After giving effect to the two-for-one common stock split effected in August 1996.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
